<title>THAILAND: Siam City Bank unaudited 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Siam City Bank unaudited 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.84     vs	     5.26</p>
<p>    Net		    3,509.06     vs	 3,160.33</p>
<p>NOTE: Siam City Bank said it changed its par value of its ordinary shares to 10 baht per share from five baht per share, effective August 8, 1996. Earnings per share in 1995 were adjusted to reflect the change in par value of shares to 10 baht. Fourth quarter figures not available.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
